"help.title" = "DriftShelf · Keep files within reach";
"help.body" = "1. Start dragging files or folders in Finder.\n2. Shake them back and forth 3 times in about 2 seconds.\n3. Drop them onto the shelf, then drag them to another window.\n\nYou can collect multiple files. Drag the bottom area to take them all. The × button hides the shelf; use the menu bar icon to show it again.\n\nThe shelf keeps references to files. Clearing it or quitting never deletes the originals. The destination app decides whether to copy or move them; hold Option in Finder to copy. Only existing local files and folders are supported, including files on mounted volumes. Attachments that have not been saved to disk are not supported.";
